        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ക്ലിനിക്ക്",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ക്ലിനിക്ക് — klinikkŭ — \"a clinic\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഞങ്ങളുടെ കവലയിൽ ഒരു ചെറിയ ക്ലിനിക്ക് ഉണ്ട്. ñaṅṅaḷuṭe kavalayil oru ceṟiya klinikkŭ uṇṭŭ. There is a small clinic at our junction."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Smaller than an ആശുപത്രി, often one doctor's rooms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ക്ലിനിക്ക് (klinikkŭ) was borrowed from English clinic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
