          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഊന്നുവടി — ūnnuvaṭi — \"a walking stick; a crutch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കാൽ ഒടിഞ്ഞ ശേഷം അവൻ ഊന്നുവടിയുമായി നടന്നു. kāl oṭiñña śēṣaṁ avan ūnnuvaṭiyumāyi naṭannu. After breaking his leg, he walked with a crutch."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഊന്നുക to lean on + വടി a stick."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഊന്നുവടി (ūnnuvaṭi) is native Dravidian, a compound of ഊന്നുക, \"to lean, to rest upon\" (DEDR 763), and വടി, \"a stick\" (DEDR 5224)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
