          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മുഖക്കുരു (mukhakkuru) is a Malayalam compound built from മുഖം, from Sanskrit mukha, \"mouth, face\" (CDIAL 10158), and കുരു, \"a pustule, a boil\", which is native (DEDR 1780)."
            }
